        <strong>Subject: </strong><span id="email-subject"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="email-body" id="email-body" aria-label="Generated email content"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="tips-section">
      <h3>4 things that double your response rate</h3>
      <div class="tips-grid">
        <div class="tip">
          <div class="tip-icon">📎</div>
          <div class="tip-title">Attach your tech pack or reference images</div>
          <div class="tip-text">Even rough sketches or a reference photo dramatically increase your reply rate. Emails with attachments signal a buyer who is ready to order.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tip">
          <div class="tip-icon">⏰</div>
          <div class="tip-title">Send during Bangladesh business hours</div>
          <div class="tip-text">Bangladesh is UTC+6. Send between 9am–1pm BST+6 (Monday–Saturday). Emails sent during their morning are read within hours, not the next day.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tip">
          <div class="tip-icon">📱</div>
          <div class="tip-title">Follow up on WhatsApp after 48 hours</div>
          <div class="tip-text">Bangladesh factories actively use WhatsApp for business communication. A brief follow-up message referencing your email doubles your response rate.</div>
