      <p>Skip the search entirely — SDF Clothing responds to all structured inquiries within 48 hours. Factory direct from Dhaka since 1998. GOTS certified, OEKO-TEX certified. MOQ from 300 pieces per style.</p>
      <div class="cta-btns">
